nk\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bMdz06tQp8IkxycOWM0Tvg</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF139.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">人物介绍</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p><font color=\"blue\"><b>儒雅随和、温厚持重</b></font>的资深骑士，<font color=\"blue\"><b>歌洛莉亚</b></font>的<font color=\"blue\"><b>老师</b></font>和<font color=\"blue\"><b>副官</b></font>。 <br />\n泰登是侍奉<font color=\"blue\"><b>罗兰家族</b></font>的从属骑士，曾是歌洛莉亚父亲最信任的<font color=\"blue\"><b>战友</b></font>，在歌洛莉亚的父亲死后，泰登辞去军职并承担起照顾<font color=\"blue\"><b>教育</b></font>歌洛莉亚的职责，<font color=\"blue\"><b>保护</b></font>着她的安危<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息256.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cc/qr2e81krpkvnnrff8m9mfyinp2muudt.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /><br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022160001\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 108/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1939/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 280/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.013      1 -total\n 57.32%   16.058      1 模板:面包屑\n 42.31%   11.853      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3202-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022160001 and revision id 6771. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"科普","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息139.png","官方消息256.jpg"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"角色印象卡|泰登","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"角色印象卡：泰登","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"角色印象卡|泰登"}],"displaytitle":"角色印象卡：泰登","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|科普}}\n=角色印象卡|泰登=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=科普\n|时间=2023-10-05 15:47\n|作者=极心测试的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bMdz06tQp8IkxycOWM0Tvg\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-col